# Git LFS. GitHub rejects blobs over 100 MB.
# Existing .png/.tga packs stay in regular Git (~1.3 GB). Tracking all of them
# would exceed GitHub's free 1 GB LFS quota. Files already over 100 MB are listed
# at the bottom. Track any new file over 100 MB before committing:
#   git lfs track "path/to/file"

*.psd filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tif filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
